  "title": "GoHealth Reports Inducement Grant Under Nasdaq Listing Rule 5635(c)(4)",
  "summary": "CHICAGO, March 17, 2023 – GoHealth, Inc. (GoHealth) (NASDAQ: GOCO), a leading health insurance marketplace and Medicare-focused digital health company, today reported that the Company granted equity-based awards pursuant to the Company’s 2021 Inducement Award Plan to Steve Moffat, the Company’s new Chief Marketing Officer; Alison Moriarty, the Company’s new Chief People Officer; and John […]",
